      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Assumptions (JAW-9959 / JAW-9963)\n- Same workflow file: architecture stub **JAW-9959** is implemented here; detailed rules in **JAW-9963**.\n- Webhook `POST /generate-email-variants` with **Outreach Webhook Header Auth**; OpenAI via **Outreach OpenAI OAuth**.\n- Personalized variants for a campaign action (`actionId` / `campaignId`); customer overview child **jaw9940-customer-overview**.\n- Variant rules: 1–5 variants; greeting + `Best regards,` closing; subject/body ≥ 10 chars; regenerate up to 3× (`$runIndex < 3`).\n- Storage: `email_action_variants`; errors: `workflow_error_logs` + Gmail to `$env.ADMIN_NOTIFY_EMAIL` (failures not silent).",
